.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH PDFLUENT-COMPRESS 1  "pdfluent 1.1.0" PDFluent
.SH NAME
pdfluent\-compress \- Reduce file size
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpdfluent compress\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\fR> [\fB\-\-level\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reduce file size
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON envelope on stdout
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-out\fR \fI<OUT>\fR
Output PDF, or `\-` for stdout
.TP
\fB\-\-level\fR \fI<LEVEL>\fR [default: strict]
Compression preset
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
strict: Full stack, no lossy passes
.IP \(bu 2
lossy: Everything strict enables, plus future lossy passes
.IP \(bu 2
archival: Maximally safe: keeps unused objects incremental updates may need
.RE
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Quiet: human mode prints data only (no warnings or progress notes)
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite the existing output file
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Verbose stderr diagnostics (repeat for more)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
Input PDF, or `\-` for stdin
.SH VERSION
v1.1.0
